cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "OmicsAtlas"
abstract: >-
  A multi-modal explorer unifying single-cell RNA-seq, spatial transcriptomics,
  ATAC-seq, and bulk RNA-seq analysis of human breast cancer, centered on
  CrossOmicsConcordance, a statistically grounded metric for scoring agreement between
  cell-type calls made independently across modalities.
authors:
